or":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":3,"created_at":"2025-03-21T09:58:21Z","updated_at":"2025-03-29T15:46:13Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n4.4 Stable\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 11 24H2 - Ryzen 7700X - 4070ti\n\n### Issue description\n\nThe Exposure multiplier in the tonemapper affects environment brightness drastically.\nThe effect is visible with or without a reflection probe, and creates inconsistencies between baked GI and the world's reflections with the latter being too bright in comparison.\nReflection probes need to update to be affected.\nSpecific to the compatibility renderer, does not occur in forward+. Haven't tested mobile.\nCould be related to #[102643](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102643)\n\n**Exposure 1:**\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e2be2415-886e-40e2-8d18-f6e162ba4566)\n\n**Exposure 5:**\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/753203be-25b5-4277-a8b8-5ac72b579291)\n\n**Exposure 5, reflection probe refreshed:**\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/22d1d536-512b-4f7e-b7ab-56656c18ab4a)\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n- Load MRP\n- Update reflection probe at exposure 1\n- Raise exposure to 5, update reflection probe again\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[compatbilityexposurereflbug.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/19386917/compatbilityexposurereflbug.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104429/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104429/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}